### Feature ProductSale — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (status = inactive)
### SIN AUTH (Fase I — Business). Ambos restauran stock y recalculan la venta.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

# @name deleteProductSalePhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ventas/{{id}}

###
# @name deleteProductSaleLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ventas/{{id}}/deactivate
